$$
\frac{9}{s} = 240 - t
$$

$$
\frac{9}{0.0896} \approx 100.65 \Rightarrow 240 - t = 100.65 \Rightarrow t = 240 - 100.65 = 139.35 \text{ minutes}
$$

---

### Final Answer:

The time it takes her to walk at **$ s + \frac{1}{2} $ km/h**, including the $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop, is:

$$
s + \frac{1}{2} = 0.0896 + 0.5 = 0.5896 \text{ km/h}
$$

