$$
912.6 \text{ minutes} + 139.35 \text{ minutes} = \boxed{1051.95 \text{ minutes}}
$$

But since the question asks for the **number of minutes** the walk takes, including the $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop, the answer is:

$$
\boxed{1051.95}
$$

